abstract: >
  Windows-SysAdmin-ProSuite is an enterprise-oriented collection of
  PowerShell and VBScript automation tools, reusable administrative
  frameworks, configuration templates, and integration examples for
  Microsoft Windows enterprise environments. The project covers Active
  Directory and Identity and Access Management (IAM), Active Directory
  Certificate Services (AD CS) and enterprise PKI, LDAP and SSO application
  integration, Group Policy administration, Windows Server and Windows 10/11
  management, WSUS administration, system configuration and deployment,
  Blue Team and Digital Forensics and Incident Response (DFIR) operations,
  security hardening, ITSM-aligned standardization, and infrastructure
  administration. The repository emphasizes modularity, repeatability,
  least-privilege administration, structured logging, operational
  traceability, controlled change management, security governance,
  maintainability, and automation suitable for enterprise environments.

